      "writtenOn": "2021-02-16T12:53:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ah I see. What I had missed is that you need the request to put it in the bundle in l.6933 (of PS14) – in spite of the comment explaining this clearly. Right, so you do need to keep a reference to this. Then my advice would be to make sure this member is always set and always what\u0027s used for all requests. After all, the comment you wrote applies to all network requests (not even limited to TRACK_DEFAULT). We could initialize it once and for all to always what\u0027s passed by the app, and when rekeying always what was in the previous one. Then you don\u0027t need the null checks.",
