      "lineNbr": 9587,
      "author": {
        "id": 1470463
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-02-16T08:35:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For the scenario you propose I believe we are good. Assuming I am understanding this correctly, I also added a unit test to validate this flow (app files TRACK_DEFAULT then policy changes after).\n\nThis check makes sure that the given UID is tracked by a per-app default before we make any changes to it. Therefore, if Google maps had a TRACK_DEFAULT active, the boolean would return True in which case it would be updated.\n\nLet me know what you think.",
      "parentUuid": "4b5cc750_926e83ca",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 9587,
        "startChar": 50,
        "endLine": 9587,
        "endChar": 100
      },
      "revId": "443ee88f053900cfcea952f81336645a19d63acc",
