      "writtenOn": "2021-02-16T23:31:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yep, you got it on when we are making these checks.\n\nAs for the scenario you mentioned, this is actually covered a couple lines up in l.9577 where we include all currently tracked requests:\n\n            // Include this nri if it is currently being tracked.\n            if (null !\u003d nri.mNetworkRequestForCallback) {\n                defaultCallbackRequests.add(nri);\n                continue;\n            }\n\nI\u0027ll update that particular check to read better after our most recent changes. Let me know what you think.",
